{
  "name": "leaderboard",
  "title": "Leaderboard",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "summary": "People see where they rank on boards the app scores (profit and loss, points, streaks), under an alias, their name, or not at all.",
  "requires": [],
  "surfaces": [
    "backend",
    "web",
    "mobile"
  ],
  "migration_block": 2800,
  "env": [
    {
      "name": "LEADERBOARD_DEFAULT_VISIBILITY",
      "tier": "backend",
      "group": "leaderboard",
      "required": "optional",
      "default": "alias",
      "doc": "How people appear until they choose: alias (a generated name), name (display name and photo) or hidden."
    }
  ],
  "files": [
    {
      "src": "backend/leaderboard",
      "dst": "backend/internal/leaderboard"
    },
    {
      "src": "backend/feature_leaderboard.go",
      "dst": "backend/internal/api/feature_leaderboard.go"
    },
    {
      "src": "migrations",
      "dst": "backend/migrations"
    },
    {
      "src": "shared",
      "dst": "packages/shared/src/leaderboard"
    },
    {
      "src": "web",
      "dst": "web/src/features/leaderboard"
    },
    {
      "src": "web-app",
      "dst": "web/app"
    },
    {
      "src": "mobile",
      "dst": "mobile/src/features/leaderboard"
    },
    {
      "src": "mobile-app",
      "dst": "mobile/app"
    }
  ],
  "wire": [
    {
      "file": "packages/shared/src/index.ts",
      "anchor": "exports",
      "insert": "export * from \"./leaderboard\";"
    },
    {
      "file": "web/src/features/registry.tsx",
      "anchor": "imports",
      "insert": "import { leaderboardHomeTile, leaderboardNav, leaderboardSettings } from \"./leaderboard/registry\";"
    },
    {
      "file": "web/src/features/registry.tsx",
      "anchor": "nav",
      "insert": "leaderboardNav,"
    },
    {
      "file": "web/src/features/registry.tsx",
      "anchor": "home",
      "insert": "leaderboardHomeTile,"
    },
    {
      "file": "web/src/features/registry.tsx",
      "anchor": "settings",
      "insert": "leaderboardSettings,"
    },
    {
      "file": "mobile/src/features/registry.tsx",
      "anchor": "imports",
      "insert": "import { leaderboardHome, leaderboardSettings } from \"./leaderboard/registry\";"
    },
    {
      "file": "mobile/src/features/registry.tsx",
      "anchor": "home",
      "insert": "leaderboardHome,"
    },
    {
      "file": "mobile/src/features/registry.tsx",
      "anchor": "settings",
      "insert": "leaderboardSettings,"
    }
  ],
  "stitch": [
    "Decide the boards: leaderboard.RegisterBoard from an init() in backend/internal/api/stitch_leaderboard.go (scheduled Scores or push-only SetScore), or a module implementing leaderboard.Source. The exchange feature's profit and loss board appears on its own.",
    "Decide the default visibility (LEADERBOARD_DEFAULT_VISIBILITY); alias keeps people anonymous until they opt in.",
    "Place the entry: the nav item and home tile ship; move or drop them in the registries if the board belongs elsewhere."
  ]
}
